\v 14 \w And Eli| strong="H5941" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto her, How long wilt thou be drunken]{strong=“H7937” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8691”}? [put away]{strong=“H5493” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8685”} \w thy wine| strong="H3196" \w* from thee. 
