\p
\v 24 [And when she had weaned]{strong=“H1580” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [him, she took him up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [with her, with three]{strong=“H7969”} \w bullocks| strong="H6499" \w*, \w and one| strong="H259" \w* \w ephah| strong="H374" \w* \w of flour| strong="H7058" \w*, \w and a bottle| strong="H5035" \w* \w of wine| strong="H3196" \w*, [and brought]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w him unto the house| strong="H1004" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* \w in Shiloh| strong="H7887" \w*: \w and the child| strong="H5288" \w* was \w young| strong="H5288" \w*. 
