\c 5
\p 
\v 1 \w And the Philistines| strong="H6430" \w* [took]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the ark| strong="H727" \w* \w of God| strong="H430" \w*, [and brought]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [it from Eben-ezer]{strong=“H72”} \w unto Ashdod| strong="H795" \w*. 
