\c 6
\p 
\v 1 \w And the ark| strong="H727" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc* \w was in the country| strong="H7704" \w* \w of the Philistines| strong="H6430" \w* \w seven| strong="H7651" \w* \w months| strong="H2320" \w*. 
\v 2 \w And the Philistines| strong="H6430" \w* [called]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w for the priests| strong="H3548" \w* [and the diviners]{strong=“H7080” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [saying]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [What shall we do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to the ark| strong="H727" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*? [tell]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8685”} [us wherewith we shall send]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w it to his place| strong="H4725" \w*. 
\v 3 [And they said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [If ye send away]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”} \w the ark| strong="H727" \w* \w of the God| strong="H430" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*, [send]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w it not empty| strong="H7387" \w*; [but in any wise]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} [return]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w him a trespass offering| strong="H817" \w*: [then ye shall be healed]{strong=“H7495” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”}, [and it shall be known]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} \w to you why his hand| strong="H3027" \w* [is not removed]{strong=“H5493” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} from you. 
