\p
\v 14 \w But one| strong="H259" \w* \w of the young men| strong="H5288" \w* [told]{strong=“H5046” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w Abigail| strong="H26" \w*, [Nabal’s]{strong=“H5037”} \w wife| strong="H802" \w*, [saying]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [Behold, David]{strong=“H1732”} [sent]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w messengers| strong="H4397" \w* \w out of the wilderness| strong="H4057" \w* [to salute]{strong=“H1288” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} \w our master| strong="H113" \w*; [and he railed]{strong=“H5860” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} on them.\f + \fr 25:14 \ft railed…: Heb. flew upon them \f* 
\v 15 \w But the men| strong="H582" \w* were \w very| strong="H3966" \w* \w good| strong="H2896" \w* [unto us, and we were not hurt]{strong=“H3637” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8717”}, [neither missed]{strong=“H6485” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w we any thing| strong="H3972" \w*, \w as long as| strong="H3117" \w* [we were conversant]{strong=“H1980” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8694”} [with them, when we were in the fields]{strong=“H7704”}:\f + \fr 25:15 \ft hurt: Heb. shamed \f* 
\v 16 \w They were a wall| strong="H2346" \w* \w unto us both by night| strong="H3915" \w* \w and day| strong="H3119" \w*, \w all the while| strong="H3117" \w* [we were with them keeping]{strong=“H7462” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w the sheep| strong="H6629" \w*. 
\v 17 [Now therefore know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [and consider]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [what thou wilt do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}; \w for evil| strong="H7451" \w* [is determined]{strong=“H3615” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w against our master| strong="H113" \w*, \w and against all his household| strong="H1004" \w*: for he is such \w a son| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Belial| strong="H1100" \w*, that a man [cannot speak]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} to him. 
\p
