\v 29 \w Yet a man| strong="H120" \w* [is risen]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [to pursue]{strong=“H7291” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [thee, and to seek]{strong=“H1245” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} \w thy soul| strong="H5315" \w*: \w but the soul| strong="H5315" \w* \w of my lord| strong="H113" \w* [shall be bound]{strong=“H6887” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} \w in the bundle| strong="H6872" \w* \w of life| strong="H2416" \w* with the \sc Lord\sc* \w thy God| strong="H430" \w*; \w and the souls| strong="H5315" \w* [of thine enemies]{strong=“H341” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, [them shall he sling out]{strong=“H7049” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”}, as out [of the middle]{strong=“H3709 H8432”} \w of a sling| strong="H7050" \w*.\f + \fr 25:29 \ft as out…: Heb. in the midst of the bought of a sling \f* 
