\v 22 \w And David| strong="H1732" \w* [answered]{strong=“H6030” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [and said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Behold the king’s]{strong=“H4428”} \w spear| strong="H2595" \w*! \w and let one| strong="H259" \w* \w of the young men| strong="H5288" \w* [come over]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [and fetch]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} it. 
\v 23 The \sc Lord\sc* [render]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w to every man| strong="H376" \w* \w his righteousness| strong="H6666" \w* \w and his faithfulness| strong="H530" \w*: for the \sc Lord\sc* [delivered]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} thee into my \w hand| strong="H3027" \w* \w to day| strong="H3117" \w*, [but I would]{strong=“H14” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [not stretch forth]{strong=“H7971” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w mine hand| strong="H3027" \w* against the \sc Lord\sc*’S \w anointed| strong="H4899" \w*. 
